<p>jab ibn-e- buturaab baroo-e- zamee'n giraa<br />
be dast ho ke qaak pa wo meh jabee'n giraa<br />
aur haath ek taraf alam-e-sheh kahi'n gira<br />
chillayi fatima ke mera naaznee'n giraa</p>

<p>kat-ta hai koi dam me sar us noujawaan ka<br />
mit-ta hai ab nashaan ali ke nashaan ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sunte hi is sadaa ke shahinshaah-e- behrobar<br />
doudhe gire uthe na sambhaala gaya jigar<br />
kaampe jo paau'n thaam liya baazu-e- pisar<br />
chillate the kaho ali akbar chale kidhar</p>

<p>majma hataao fouj-e- sitam kaa taraayi se<br />
beta milaado jald mujhe mere bhaai se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>akbar ujad gaya mere ghar waa musibataa<br />
seedhi na hogi ab ye kamar waa musibataa<br />
hai aaj taaza daagh-e- pidar waa musibataa<br />
kaata gaya churi se jigar waa musibataaa</p>

<p>pursa to du najaf ki taraf mu to mod do<br />
sar peet'ta chalunga mere haath chod do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>akbar qareeb-e- laash jo laaye hussain ko<br />
abbas jaa'n balab nazar aaye hussain ko<br />
tadpa wo sher sunke sadaa-e- hussain ko<br />
akbar ne haath uthaake dikhaaye hussain ko</p>

<p>do koh-e- gham ke dil pa jo ek baar gir pade<br />
pehlu me laash ki shah-e- abraar gir pade<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ek baar ghash se chounk ke abbas-e- zee weqaar<br />
aur jaa'n kani me aankho'n ko khola ba haal-e- zaar<br />
poocha kidhar ho aye mere aaqa-e- naamdaar<br />
hazrat lipat ke bhaai se bole ke mai nisaar</p>

<p>sadme hai jaa'n kani se fuzoo'n is judaayi ke<br />
bhai ka daagh pooche koi dil se bhaai ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bhaai tumhaari baali sakina jigar figaar<br />
bacchou se keh rahi hai ye ba chashm ashkbaar<br />
ek lehza aur sabr karo tum pa mai nisaar<br />
dekho ke jaa'n balab hai mera bhaai sheerqaar</p>

<p>pyaasi hu mai bhi teen din aur teen raat se<br />
ab paani laate hoyenge ammu furaat se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hai kuch wasiyate'n meri is waqt ya imaam<br />
un me se ek ye hai tasadduq ho jab ghulaam<br />
saahil se laash uth ke na jaaye su-e- qayaam<br />
jis jaa pada ho qabr ka bhi ho wahi maqaam</p>

<p>sarke na qaanazaad imaam-e- diler ka<br />
maskan rahe taraayi me hyder ke sher ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aur doosri ye arz hai aye shaah-e- nek qoo<br />
shahzaadiyaa mahal se na nikle kushaada moo<br />
dekhe na aake baali sakina mera lahoo<br />
aur ek marte marte hai ye dil ki aarzoo</p>

<p>aaye lahad me boo-e- imaam-e- zaman mujhe<br />
baqshe huzoor apni abaa ka kafan mujhe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sun kar ye haal dil pa laga aur teer-e-gham<br />
roye lahu ke ashko'n se abbas-e- zee hasham<br />
itna kaha ke reh gaye sharminda us se ham<br />
pahonchaate mashk haath na hote agar qalam</p>

<p>kuch bas chala ajal se na is bequsoor ka<br />
majboor hogaya ye behishthi huzoor ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sar peet kar ye kehne lage shaah-e- behrobar<br />
abbas tukde karte ho kyu bhaai ka jigar<br />
acha na laash uthaayega yaa'n se ye nouhagar<br />
turbat banegi aapki be shubha naher par</p>

<p>sach hai ke behre sher taraayi zaroor hai<br />
bhaai magar tumhaari lahed ham se door hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke daal'di tan-e- purnoor par abaa<br />
farmaaya ab to shaad huwe tum pa mai fidaa<br />
ye qillat-e- aqeer hai aye mere dil rubaa<br />
is ko bhi loot lenge magar baaniye jafaa</p>

<p>chin jaayegi ridaae'n bhi is ish'dehaam me<br />
sar nange bewe'n niklengi balwaa-e-aam me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sun ke paa-e-shaah ki jaanib jhukaaya sar<br />
kaanpe lahu bhari huwi aankho'n ko khol kar<br />
tapke mizaah se qoon ke qatre idhar udhar<br />
kis yaas se hussain pa ki aaqri nazar</p>

<p>manka jari kaa dhal gaya bhai ke saamne<br />
bhaai ka dam nikal gaya bhaai ke saamne<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>